+- Bound ordinary Git probes to 2MiB stdout, 64KiB stderr and 10,000 complete status entries; refuse overflow instead of claiming a clean tree. Share immutable change lists across same-worktree/cwd fanout, Review clones and planning snapshots.
+- Own App Server stderr drains with the transport, including failed initialization and successful/replaced auxiliary searches; retain exact-pipe, writer-alive controls in the existing PTY regression suite.
+
